---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import { site } from '../data/site'
import EditorialFrame from '../components/editorial/EditorialFrame.astro'
---

<Layout>
  <EditorialFrame class="ed-utility">
    <section class="section page-intro ed-utility-intro">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">Your information</p>
        <h1>
          Privacy,
          <br />
          <span class="serif">in plain language.</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
    </section>
    <article class="section container reading-width prose ed-prose">
      <h2>Your information</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not use analytics, advertising cookies, account
        registration, or a database. Fonts and visual assets are served with the
        site.
      </p>
      <h2>Project inquiries</h2>
      <p>
        The brief form processes what you type in your browser. After preparing
        a draft, choose “Open email draft” to open your email application, or
        download a copy. It does not submit or store your information on this
        website. You review and send the message yourself. Information you
        choose to email is used to respond to your inquiry; do not include
        passwords or confidential client data.
      </p>
      <h2>External services</h2>
      <p>
        Booking opens Calendly in a new tab. Information entered there is
        handled by Calendly under its own privacy practices. Social links also
        open external websites. No third-party booking or social widgets are
        embedded here.
      </p>
      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        When deployed on Cloudflare, ordinary requests are handled by Cloudflare
        infrastructure. The provider may process connection information, such as
        IP addresses, for delivery and security.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> for questions
        about your information or to request deletion of an inquiry. This notice
        will be reviewed if analytics or a server-based contact service is
        introduced.
      </p>
    </article>
  </EditorialFrame>
</Layout>
